  "description": "C# bindings for geompp, a C++20 2D/3D computational geometry library.\n      Provides Point2D/3D, Vector2D/3D, Line2D/3D, Ray2D/3D, LineSegment2D/3D,\n      Polyline2D/3D, Triangle2D/3D, Polygon2D/3D, BBox2D/3D, BBall2D/3D,\n      BRect2D, BPrism3D, Plane — with full operator support, intersection\n      queries, convex hull, bounding containers, WKT serialization, and file I/O.\n      Built with C++/CLI for Windows x64. Targets .NET 8, 9, 10 and .NET Framework 4.8.",
